   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sanitation for the Valley of Mexico</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONSTRUCTION OF 4 WASTE WATER TREATMENT PLANTS WITH A TOTAL CAPACITY OF 74.5M3SEC. REHABILITATION OF THE DRAINAGE SYSTEM OF THE METROPOLITAN ZONE OF MEXICO CITY. PROGRAM FOR CONTROLLING INDUSTRIAL WASTE, PUBLIC HEALTH AND ENVIRONMENTAL EDUCATION AND STRENGTHENING OF WATER SYSTEMS, FINANCING OF STUDIES AND CONSULTING SERVICES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
